  "description": "Studio Apartment (38–42 sq.m)\n\nA beautifully considered studio designed around modern living. Floor-to-ceiling windows and a spacious balcony with outdoor furniture make the most of the city, coastal and mountain views, while a contemporary two-tone kitchen with solid worktops and integrated Neff appliances keeps everything close to hand. Includes fitted wardrobes, a separate utility room with washer/dryer and additional storage, and a spacious bathroom with terrazzo-effect feature tiling, a dual shower head with rain shower, heated chrome towel rail and large fitted mirror. Plush furnishings curated by an interior designer complete the home.",
